  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Simple_Backups/BH_SB_Header.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"229\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">此模組用於創建備份。您可以設定要保留的備份數量，也可以設定最大存儲空間上限。最舊的備份檔案將被自動刪除。<br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">此模組僅適用於伺服器端。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">手動備份可使用以下指令觸發：&nbsp;</span>/simplebackups backup start</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fmelanx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Simple_Backups/BH_SB_PromoCard.png\" alt=\"廣告\" width=\"1903\" height=\"381\"></span></a><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">#廣告 #Ad</span></span></p>",
